\">\n</p><aside role=\"region\" class=\"portable-infobox pi-background pi-border-color pi-theme-wikia pi-layout-default\">\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-item-spacing pi-title pi-secondary-background\" data-source=\"title\">100% Bosco.</h2>\n\n<figure class=\"pi-item pi-image\">\n\t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/100%25_Bosco..png/revision/latest?cb=20230519081535\" class=\"image image-thumbnail\" title=\"100% Bosco.\">\n\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/100%25_Bosco..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230519081535\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/100%25_Bosco..png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230519081535 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/task/images/2/27/100%25_Bosco..png/revision/latest?cb=20230519081535 2x\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" data-relevant=\"1\" alt=\"100% Bosco.\" width=\"270\" height=\"152\" data-image-key=\"100%25_Bosco..png\" data-image-name=\"100% Bosco..png\" />\n\t\t\n\t</a>\n\t\n</figure>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"series\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Series</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">15</a></div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"episode\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Episode</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">8</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"winner\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Winner</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\"><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</a></div>\n</div>\n<h2 class=\"pi-item pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-item-spacing pi-secondary-background\">Episode Guide</h2>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\">← Previous</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\">Next →</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"previous\"><a href=\"/wiki/Schr%C3%B6dinger%27s_egg.\" title=\"Schrödinger&#39;s egg.\">Schrödinger's egg.</a></td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"next\"><a href=\"/wiki/A_show_about_pedantry.\" title=\"A show about pedantry.\">A show about pedantry.</a></td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><i><b>100% Bosco.</b></i> is the eighth episode of <a href=\"/wiki/Series_15\" title=\"Series 15\">Series 15</a> of <i><a href=\"/wiki/Taskmaster\" title=\"Taskmaster\">Taskmaster</a></i> and was first broadcast on <a href=\"/wiki/Channel_4\" title=\"Channel 4\">Channel 4</a> on 18 May 2023. The episode was won by <a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</a>.\n</p>\n<div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Episode_title\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode title</span></a>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-2 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Alternate_titles\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1.1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Alternate titles</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Episode_breakdown\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Episode breakdown</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#External_links\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">External links</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_title\">Episode title</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode title\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/100%25_Bosco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=1\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode title\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\">Mae Martin</a> used the phrase \"100% Bosco\" during the <a href=\"/wiki/Repurpose_this_umbrella_and_demonstrate_its_new_purpose\" title=\"Repurpose this umbrella and demonstrate its new purpose\">Repurpose this umbrella and demonstrate its new purpose</a> task. The title card is of a pineapple slice on a yellow jelly, referencing the <a href=\"/wiki/Pile_the_pineapples_on_the_path\" title=\"Pile the pineapples on the path\">Pile the pineapples on the path</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_stuff_on_top_of_this_jelly\" title=\"Put the most stuff on top of this jelly\">Put the most stuff on top of this jelly</a> tasks.\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Alternate_titles\">Alternate titles</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/100%25_Bosco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=2\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Alternate titles\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<ul><li>On Finland's MTV Katsomo streaming platform, this episode is titled 'Sataprosenttista Boscoa', which translates as '100% Bosco'.<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Episode_breakdown\">Episode breakdown</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/100%25_Bosco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=3\" aria-label=\"Edit section: Episode breakdown\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<div class=\"mbox\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;wrapper\"><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;header\">Spoilers!</div><div class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;content&#95;&#95;text mw-collapsible\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-spoilers\">This section contains spoilers.</div><span class=\"mbox&#95;&#95;close mw-customtoggle-spoilers\" title=\"Dismiss\"></span></div></div></div>\n<table class=\"tmtable\">\n\n<tbody><tr class=\"tmtableheader\">\n<th>Task\n</th>\n<th>Description\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Frankie_Boyle\" title=\"Frankie Boyle\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Frankie Boyle</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Ivo_Graham\" title=\"Ivo Graham\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Ivo Graham</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Jenny_Eclair\" title=\"Jenny Eclair\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Jenny Eclair</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Kiell_Smith-Bynoe\" title=\"Kiell Smith-Bynoe\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Kiell Smith-Bynoe</span></a>\n</th>\n<th><a href=\"/wiki/Mae_Martin\" title=\"Mae Martin\"><span style=\"color:#FFF;\">Mae Martin</span></a>\n</th></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Best_thing_you_take_everywhere_with_you_but_struggle_to_fit_in_your_bag\" title=\"Best thing you take everywhere with you but struggle to fit in your bag\">1</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Prize:</b> Best thing you take everywhere with you but struggle to fit in your bag.\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Pile_the_pineapples_on_the_path\" title=\"Pile the pineapples on the path\">2</a>\n</td>\n<td>Pile the pineapples on the path. You must not get wet.\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Repurpose_this_umbrella_and_demonstrate_its_new_purpose\" title=\"Repurpose this umbrella and demonstrate its new purpose\">3</a>\n</td>\n<td>Repurpose this umbrella and demonstrate its new purpose.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>2\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Put_the_most_stuff_on_top_of_this_jelly\" title=\"Put the most stuff on top of this jelly\">4</a>\n</td>\n<td>Put the most stuff on top of this jelly without breaking the jelly. If anything other than jelly touches the duck, you are disqualified.\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td>\n<td>1\n</td>\n<td>4\n</td>\n<td>DQ\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtablerow\">\n<td><a href=\"/wiki/Remove_as_many_balls_from_your_suit_as_possible\" title=\"Remove as many balls from your suit as possible\">5</a>\n</td>\n<td><b>Team Live:</b> Using only the scratching posts, remove as many balls from your suit as possible. Your teammates may throw balls from the throwing spots throughout. The throwing spots may not be moved. Also, if you're in a team of three, the two non-suit wearers must hold hands throughout.\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td>3\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td>\n<td><b>5</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr class=\"tmtabletotal\">\n<th colspan=\"2\">Total\n</th>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td>12\n</td>\n<td>16\n</td>\n<td class=\"tmtablewinner\">20\n</td>\n<td>18\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"External_links\">External links</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Edit section: External links\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"edit-section-anon\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://taskmaster.fandom.com/wiki/100%25_Bosco.?veaction=edit&amp;section=4\" aria-label=\"Edit section: External links\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://taskmaster.tv/shows/100-bosco\"><i>100% Bosco.</i> on Taskmaster website</a></li>\n<li><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.channel4.com/programmes/taskmaster/on-demand/\"><i>100% Bosco.</i> on All 4</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260920124353\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.102 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.141 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 824/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 25949/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 174/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 8/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip po